    "Click, then press a new combination. It must include ⌘/⌃/⌥. Press Esc to cancel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click, then press a new combination. It must include ⌘/⌃/⌥. Press Esc to cancel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击后按下新的组合键，需包含 ⌘/⌃/⌥；按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下後按下新的組合鍵，需包含 ⌘/⌃/⌥；按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クリックしてから新しい組み合わせを押します。⌘/⌃/⌥ のいずれかが必要です。Esc でキャンセル。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
